Ya.

524
00:41:33,080 --> 00:41:34,480
Kejadiannya malam hari.

525
00:41:38,040 --> 00:41:39,720
Orang dewasa kadang bertengkar.

526
00:41:40,520 --> 00:41:42,640
Bukan berarti itu serius.

527
00:41:44,160 --> 00:41:46,200
Kurasa kalian bertengkar soal aku.

528
00:41:47,160 --> 00:41:49,880
Tidak, ini bukan salahmu.

529
00:41:51,640 --> 00:41:52,680
